  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うん、春だなぁ……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "見てるだけで春を感じるんだから、桜ってすごいよな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003010110070,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "うんうん！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301011/2003010110070"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003010110080,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "見てるだけで\r\nなんだか心がざわざわするの……！",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301011/2003010110080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ははっ、ざわざわか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003010110090,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "うんっ！　なんていうか、\r\n嬉しいみたいな、そわそわするみたいな……",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301011/2003010110090"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003010110100,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "けど、ちょっと寂しいみたいな……\r\n不思議な感じ！",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301011/2003010110100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ……うん、なんとなくわかるよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003010110110,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "ほんと！？",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301011/2003010110110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うん\r\nやっぱり、節目の花だからじゃないかな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "出会ったり、別れたり……\r\nそういう季節に咲く花だろ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003010110120,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "……あぁー！\r\n学校にも絶対あるしね",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301011/2003010110120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうそう\r\n入学式や卒業式も桜モチーフだし……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "新学年に上がるのも春だし、\r\nたいていクラス替えとかがあって、新しい人と出会う",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "だから、嬉しい気持ちも寂しい気持ちも\r\n桜の花と一緒に覚えてるんだろうなぁ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003010110130,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "そっか……",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301011/2003010110130"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003010110140,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "うん、そうかも……",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301011/2003010110140"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003010110150,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "でも、わたしね、\r\nワクワクしたり、嬉しい気持ちのほうが強いかも！",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301011/2003010110150"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003010110160,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "新しい出会いとか、新しいお仕事とか……",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301011/2003010110160"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003010110170,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "新しいことも\r\nたくさんはじまる季節だなって思うから……",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301011/2003010110170"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003010110180,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
